{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46189","headline":"山居诗二十四首 三 · 贯休","name":"山居诗二十四首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"好鸟声长睡眼开，好茶擎乳坐莓苔。\n不闻荣辱成番尽，只见熊罴作队来。\n诗里从前欺白雪，道情终遣似婴孩。\n由来此事知音少，不是真风去不回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46189.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46189","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}